<title>CANADA: Suncor Inc lowers Canada oil prices.</title>
<headline>Suncor Inc lowers Canada oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suncor Inc said it lowered the price it would pay for Edmonton light sweet crude oil by C$4.00/cubic metre or C$0.64/barrel, to C$190.00/cubic metre or C$30.21 per barrel, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Other new prices were listed as follows:</p>
<p>Cromer light sour C$183.00/cubic metre, or C$29.09/barrel</p>
<p>Midale at Cromer C$164.00/cubic metre, or C$26.07/barrel</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
</text>
